stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> BOOKED
    BOOKED --> CHECKED_IN : vehicle arrives, advisor checks in
    BOOKED --> CANCELLED : customer 24h+ before, or dispatcher
    BOOKED --> NO_SHOW : start + 30 min grace
    CHECKED_IN --> IN_PROGRESS : technician starts
    CHECKED_IN --> CANCELLED : customer declines work
    IN_PROGRESS --> ON_HOLD : PARTS or CUSTOMER_APPROVAL, technician released
    ON_HOLD --> IN_PROGRESS : resume, remaining minutes re-reserved
    IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : workshop work done, bay and technician released
    COMPLETED --> [*] : QC, hand-over, invoice live in the DMS repair order
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    NO_SHOW --> [*]
